OL,3,GNEWSAShelter swamped with rescued
OL,4,Akittens and cats
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn animal rescue charity is reporting
OL,7,Fan explosion in the number of kittens
OL,8,Fand cats needing rehoming, with staff
OL,9,Frecently finding 30 at just one Hull
OL,10,Fhome.
OL,12,FSue Sewell, of Hull Animal Welfare
OL,13,FTrust (HAWT), based in South Cave,
OL,14,Fsaid: "It's the worst I've ever known
OL,15,Fit. We're inundated."
OL,17,FShe urged owners to ensure their pets
OL,18,Fwere neutered, and said the charity had
OL,19,Frecently bought a pet ambulance,
OL,20,Fenabling teams to visit hotspots to
OL,21,Fcarry out the procedures at minimum
OL,22,Fcost.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
